# Introduction

COSS for Svelte ports the COSS component library to Svelte 5. Components keep the upstream visual
design while their public APIs follow current Svelte and Shards UI conventions.

The component port is in progress. The registry command will be documented once the first reviewed
component ships.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Button } from "$lib/components/ui/button/index.js";
</script>

<Button>Save changes</Button>
```
